| 10,000 items | ~12,000 ms (12s) | ~15 ms | **800x** |
| 100,000 items | ~20 minutes (est) | ~120 ms | **~10,000x** |

*Note: Tests performed on a modern i7 processor. As the dataset grows, the performance gap grows exponentially.*

